    {
      "id": "UkpH3ZKjs6QMByFZnprDL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3743.564660238599,
      "y": 132.6582073293821,
      "width": 968.1385498046875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1660326507,
      "version": 312,
      "versionNonce": 1348742443,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786358847904,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The Game Service, to own that authoritative state. It validates incoming moves, manages the two clocks, \n    and pushes validated moves to the opponent.\n2. When a game ends, the Game Service computes the new ELO (the fancy chess rating) \n     for both players from the result and each player's rating as of the start of the game.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The Game Service, to own that authoritative state. It validates incoming moves, manages the two clocks, \n    and pushes validated moves to the opponent.\n2. When a game ends, the Game Service computes the new ELO (the fancy chess rating) \n     for both players from the result and each player's rating as of the start of the game.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
